  "description": "High-performance, fully managed .NET networking library for TCP, UDP, and WebSocket communication. Features built-in peer-to-peer with NAT traversal, pluggable System.Text.Json serialization, SslStream TLS 1.2 encryption, GZip/Deflate compression, bandwidth throttling, and live WPF control sharing. Send any object across a unified, transport-agnostic API. Targets .NET Standard 2.1, .NET 8",
